WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Cash flow over time. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Place receipts and payments on a timeline

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Cash flow tracks when money enters and leaves. Timing can matter even when the total project cost is unchanged.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: Place a $600 payment in week one and a $600 reimbursement in week four; the interim cash need is still $600.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Timeline puzzle

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: Teaching relationships only—not live quotes, prices, tax advice or forecasts.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Place receipts and payments on a timeline
